<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title> ZOZUPAY | Coming Soon</title>

    <meta name="description"
          content="ZOZUPAY is coming soon. Business funding solutions for UK businesses.">

    <link rel="icon"
          href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zozupay/Assets/main/LOGO_Transparent.png">

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html,
        body {
            width: 100%;
            min-height: 100%;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI",
                         Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f7faf8;
            color: #17352d;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        /* =========================
           HEADER
        ========================== */

        header {
            width: 100%;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e8eeeb;
        }

        .header-inner {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 22px 30px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .logo img {
            width: 150px;
            height: auto;
            display: block;
        }

        /* =========================
           MAIN
        ========================== */

        main {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 70px 25px;
        }

        .coming-soon {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 850px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            background: #e8f3ee;
            color: #26735b;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .badge-dot {
            width: 7px;
            height: 7px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #26735b;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: clamp(44px, 7vw, 78px);
            line-height: 1.05;
            letter-spacing: -2.5px;
            font-weight: 750;
            color: #17352d;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .highlight {
            color: #26735b;
        }

        .intro {
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: 0 auto 38px;
            font-size: 19px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #5d6e68;
        }

        .message-box {
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #e1e9e5;
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 25px 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(23, 53, 45, 0.06);
        }

        .message-box p {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #596b65;
        }

        .contact {
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .contact a {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 13px 24px;
            border-radius: 9px;
            background: #26735b;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 650;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .contact a:hover {
            background: #1e5f4b;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        /* =========================
           FOOTER
        ========================== */

        footer {
            background: #17352d;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 32px 25px;
        }

        .footer-inner {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-end;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 35px;
        }

        .footer-company {
            max-width: 600px;
        }

        .footer-company h2 {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .footer-company p {
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #c8d6d1;
        }

        .footer-company a {
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .footer-company a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .footer-right {
            text-align: right;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .footer-right p {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #aebfba;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .copyright {
            margin-top: 7px;
        }

        /* =========================
           MOBILE
        ========================== */

        @media (max-width: 700px) {

            .header-inner {
                padding: 18px 20px;
            }

            .logo img {
                width: 135px;
            }

            main {
                padding: 60px 20px;
            }

            h1 {
                letter-spacing: -1.5px;
            }

            .intro {
                font-size: 17px;
                line-height: 1.65;
            }

            .message-box {
                padding: 22px 20px;
            }

            .footer-inner {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: flex-start;
            }

            .footer-right {
                text-align: left;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- =========================
         HEADER
    ========================== -->

    <header>
        <div class="header-inner">

            <a href="/" class="logo" aria-label="ZOZUPAY">
                <img
                    src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zozupay/Assets/main/LOGO_Transparent.png"
                    alt="ZOZUPAY">
            </a>

        </div>
    </header>


    <!-- =========================
         MAIN CONTENT
    ========================== -->

    <main>

        <section class="coming-soon">

            <div class="badge">
                <span class="badge-dot"></span>
                Coming Soon
            </div>

            <h1>
                Something <span class="highlight">new</span><br>
                is coming.
            </h1>

            <p class="intro">
                ZOZUPAY is currently preparing something new for UK businesses.
                Our website will be launching soon.
            </p>

            <div class="message-box">

                <p>
                    We are working behind the scenes to bring you a simple
                    and straightforward way to access business funding.
                    Please check back soon for more information.
                </p>

                <div class="contact">
                    <a href="mailto:info@zozupay.co.uk">
                        Contact ZOZUPAY
                    </a>
                </div>

            </div>

        </section>

    </main>


    <!-- =========================
         FOOTER
    ========================== -->

    <footer>

        <div class="footer-inner">

            <div class="footer-company">

                <h2>ZOZU PAY LIMITED</h2>

                <p>
                    Trading as ZOZUPAY<br>
                    Company Registration No. 17454744<br>
                    Registered Office: 128 City Road, London, EC1V 2NX, United Kingdom<br>
                    Email:
                    <a href="mailto:info@zozupay.co.uk">
                        info@zozupay.co.uk
                    </a>
                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="footer-right">

                <p>
                    © 2026 ZOZUPAY. All rights reserved.
                </p>

                <p class="copyright">
                    ZOZU PAY LIMITED
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </footer>

</body>
</html>
